<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PrimeViz</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{font-family:Inter,sans-serif;background:#0b0b0b;color:#fff;overflow-x:hidden}
header{position:fixed;top:0;width:100%;z-index:1000;background:rgba(0,0,0,.75);backdrop-filter:blur(10px)}
nav{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:18px 5%}
.hero{height:100vh;background:url('hero.jpg') center/cover fixed;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center}
.hero:before{content:'';position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45)}
.hero-content{position:relative;z-index:2;animation:fadeUp 1s ease}
h1{font-size:clamp(2.5rem,6vw,5rem)}
.btn{background:#19b7e3;padding:15px 30px;border-radius:40px;color:#fff;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block;margin-top:20px;transition:.3s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-3px)}
section{padding:100px 5%}
.section-title{text-align:center;font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:50px}
.gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(320px,1fr));gap:25px}
.card{overflow:hidden;border-radius:22px;background:#141414;transition:.4s}
.card img{width:100%;height:320px;object-fit:cover;transition:.6s}
.card:hover img{transform:scale(1.08)}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px)}
.parallax{background:url('parallax.jpg') center/cover fixed;height:50vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center}
.testimonials{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:20px}
.testimonial{background:#151515;padding:30px;border-radius:20px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:40px;background:#000}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px);transition:1s}
.reveal.active{opacity:1;transform:none}
@keyframes fadeUp{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(40px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}
@media(max-width:768px){
nav{padding:15px}
.hero{background-attachment:scroll}
.parallax{background-attachment:scroll}
.gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}
h1{font-size:2.3rem}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header>
<nav>
<h2>PrimeViz</h2>
<a href="https://w.app/kwyiax" class="btn">WhatsApp</a>
</nav>
</header>

<section class="hero">
<div class="hero-content">
<h1>Visualização Arquitetônica Extraordinária</h1>
<p>Imagens que vendem projetos antes mesmo de serem construídos.</p>
<a href="https://w.app/kwyiax" class="btn">Solicitar orçamento</a>
</div>
</section>

<section class="reveal">
<h2 class="section-title">Portfólio</h2>
<div class="gallery">
<div class="card"><img src="img1.jpg"></div>
<div class="card"><img src="img2.jpg"></div>
<div class="card"><img src="img3.jpg"></div>
<div class="card"><img src="img4.jpg"></div>
<div class="card"><img src="img5.jpg"></div>
<div class="card"><img src="img6.jpg"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="parallax">
<div>
<h2 style="font-size:3rem">Detalhes que impressionam</h2>
</div>
</section>

<section class="reveal">
<h2 class="section-title">O que nossos clientes dizem</h2>
<div class="testimonials">
<div class="testimonial">“Qualidade impressionante. As imagens ajudaram a fechar vendas.”</div>
<div class="testimonial">“Entrega rápida e nível visual acima do esperado.”</div>
<div class="testimonial">“Os renders elevaram completamente a apresentação do empreendimento.”</div>
</div>
</section>

<section style="text-align:center" class="reveal">
<h2 class="section-title">Vamos criar algo incrível?</h2>
<a href="https://w.app/kwyiax" class="btn">Falar no WhatsApp</a>
</section>

<footer>© PrimeViz</footer>

<script>
const observer=new IntersectionObserver(entries=>{
entries.forEach(e=>{if(e.isIntersecting)e.target.classList.add('active')})
});
document.querySelectorAll('.reveal').forEach(el=>observer.observe(el));
</script>
</body>
</html>
